				<wikidot:authorName>XilasCrowe</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2969291</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I don't really have an argument for this. I guess all I can say is that they're designated different due to different reasons for being designated. -1 are still anomalies, while -A is just any random person who decides to get freaky. Styling them the same way would have made them too similar or something, I have no idea. Hell if I know.</p> <p><span style="font-size:50%;">Also, if you hate differing designation, I have another draft you are absolutely going to hate. Like, oh man that thing has so so many.</span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
