				<wikidot:authorName>Proasek</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2048131</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>That is not the requirement for a -J skip. A -J would be written with no intent to be serious, whereas a skip on the mainlist is fully entitled to be amusing, but always taken seriously within the universe.</p> <p>If anything, this article works purely because this is serious in-universe, knowing that while the Foundation is dealing with this at the same time as it's dealing with world ending Keters.</p> 
				 	]]>
