					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10706349#post-4190501</guid>
				<title>so, uhhhhhh, yea, I guess</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10706349/scp-3684#post-4190501</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2019 22:44:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>XilasCrowe</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2969291</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>For those of you who don't know, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weryllium" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2727655&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1553042297" alt="Weryllium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2727655)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weryllium" >Weryllium</a></span> and I have a bet going. Every time he writes something longer than 1.5K words, I have to write something. Well, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4789">SCP-4789</a> broke that, at like 1.7K or something. So, this is my response.</p> <p>For some credits:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/panteradactyl" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000286&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1553042297" alt="Panteradactyl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000286)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/panteradactyl" >Panteradactyl</a></span> for loving this throughout its conception and always asking me when it was coming out<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1553042297" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span> for being the first reader of the mostly finished product, and <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">hating</span> loving every second of this abomination &quot;I think I love it&quot;<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;times